{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01300","headline":"相和歌辞 长门怨 · 徐贤妃","name":"相和歌辞 长门怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧爱柏梁台，新宠昭阳殿。\n守分辞方辇，含情泣团扇。\n一朝歌舞荣，夙昔诗书贱。\n颓恩诚已矣，覆水难重荐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐贤妃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}